{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candy Destroyer</strong> is a <strong>colorful 2D platformer and PvP battle game</strong> where two unique characters face off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers <strong>two main modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local 1v1 PvP</strong> \u2013 fast-paced, intense battles across various maps; the first player to reach the score limit wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 navigate colorful platforming levels filled with obstacles, offering a fun and challenging singleplayer experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 perfect for short or long play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, cartoonish 2D visuals with a fantasy style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of projectiles and superpowers for strategic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for 2 players and singleplayer story mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions, magic effects, and dynamic visuals for an engaging experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the sweet chaos and see who will come out on top!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some visual assets used in this game are provided by Freepik.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by Freepik </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076740?t=1769157709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076740?t=1769157709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076740/c14471da3523c2801410a849916d5d109fed9c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769157709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets